+#### Scenario: Secret-matching omission advice identifiers are counted per list
+
+- **WHEN** the omission advice comparison yields ordered distinct lists, the bound path-side detector matches an identifier in both `duplicated` and `unmatched`, and the text-side detector matches a different identifier with a path-side denial in `alsoCovered`
