+- **AND** the check result and stored check record for this draft have the outcome and bytes defined by the existing coverage comparison and advice rules
+
+#### Scenario: Omission advice cannot establish a screening decision
+
+- **WHEN** an otherwise completed comparison has an omission identifier in one of the three report lists and bound screening cannot establish the required decision
+- **THEN** the advice is `{"state": "unknown", "why": "omission advice screening was unavailable", "note"}` with the fixed reason
+- **AND** check's outcome and stored record follow the rules for that draft and completed comparison
